---
import DealerLayout from '../../layouts/DealerLayout.astro';
---
<DealerLayout title="LTB - Cổng Đại Lý B2B | Bia Long Thành" bodyClass="bg-surface font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface antialiased" active="danh-muc-dat-hang">
<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-200px)]"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<!-- Top Progress & Context Meta Strip -->
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-high px-gutter py-space-sm">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-md flex-wrap">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs font-semibold text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary">verified_user</span>
          CỔNG ĐẠI LÝ B2B — PHÂN HỆ TIẾP NHẬN ĐƠN SỈ
        </span>
<span class="text-outline-variant hidden sm:inline">/</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant">Khu vực B: Dealer Order Intake (BRD v1.2 Compliant)</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-lg">
<span class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">schedule</span>
          Thời gian phản hồi SLA tiêu chuẩn: <strong class="text-primary font-semibold">Tối đa 60 Phút</strong>
</span>
<span class="text-outline-variant hidden sm:inline">|</span>
<span class="text-on-surface-variant font-mono">Phiên giao dịch: #TXN-2024-8849</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter py-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-lg">
<!-- Executive Header with Agency Credentials -->
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-md border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase px-space-sm py-0.5 rounded tracking-wider">Hệ thống B2B</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Đồng Nai Brewery Commercial Node</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary tracking-tight">Tạo Yêu Cầu Đặt Hàng B2B (Order Intake)</h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Đăng ký sản lượng bia keg, bia đóng lon và nước giải khát theo định mức thương mại định kỳ.</p>
</div>
<!-- Verified Dealer Profile Pill Box -->
<div class="bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded flex items-center gap-space-md">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-primary-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]">storefront</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">NPP Đồ Uống Miền Đông</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 px-space-xs py-0.5 bg-primary-fixed/50 text-on-primary-fixed-variant rounded text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span> Hoạt động
            </span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span>Mã đại lý: <strong class="text-on-surface font-mono">LTB-DL-360382</strong></span>
<span>•</span>
<span>Hạng: Cấp 1 Toàn Phần</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- MANDATORY BRD v1.2 ALERT BANNER (Warm Amber / Strict Policy Notice) -->
<div class="w-full bg-secondary-container/20 p-space-md rounded flex items-start gap-space-md border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-secondary-container flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-container">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">gavel</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-secondary-container uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">LƯU Ý NGHIỆP VỤ B2B BẮT BUỘC (QUY TRÌNH BRD v1.2)</span>
<span class="px-space-xs py-0.5 bg-secondary text-on-secondary rounded text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Nghiêm ngặt</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
<strong>Website không công bố giá đại lý và không cam kết tồn kho tự động.</strong> Số lượng quý khách gửi tại biểu mẫu này là <strong>yêu cầu đặt hàng</strong> (Purchase Request). Nhân viên phụ trách kinh doanh LTB (Account Representative) sẽ liên hệ trực tiếp để thẩm định hạn mức, áp dụng khung chiết khấu hợp đồng năm, thông báo số lượng thực tế tại kho Nhà máy Đồng Nai và cấp <strong>Bản Xác Nhận Đơn Hàng Chính Thức</strong> trong vòng <strong>60 phút</strong> làm việc.
        </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 4-Step Approval & Fulfillment Pipeline Status Indicator -->
<div class="w-full bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-sm">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-wider font-bold flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">account_tree</span>
          Quy Trình Chuyển Đổi Trạng Thái Yêu Cầu Thương Mại
        </span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Chuẩn ISO 9001:2015 B2B Supply Chain</span>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-space-sm relative">
<!-- Step 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex flex-col gap-space-xs relative overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="h-1 bg-secondary w-full absolute top-0 left-0"></div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-secondary">BƯỚC 01</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[18px]">send</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-bold">1. Đã gửi yêu cầu</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Hệ thống ghi nhận nhu cầu, cấp số phiếu PR tạm thời.</span>
<span class="mt-space-xs inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-secondary font-mono tracking-wider">[ĐANG THỰC HIỆN]</span>
</div>
<!-- Step 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex flex-col gap-space-xs border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-outline">BƯỚC 02</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[18px]">manage_search</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">2. Đang xem xét</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">NVKD thẩm tra tồn kho Đồng Nai &amp; biểu giá chiết khấu.</span>
<span class="mt-space-xs inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface-variant font-mono tracking-wider">Thời hạn ≤ 60 phút</span>
</div>
<!-- Step 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex flex-col gap-space-xs border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-outline">BƯỚC 03</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[18px]">edit_note</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">3. Chờ đối chiếu</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Đại lý tinh chỉnh số lượng hoặc xác nhận thay đổi (nếu có).</span>
<span class="mt-space-xs inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-on-surface-variant font-mono tracking-wider">Tương tác 2 chiều</span>
</div>
<!-- Step 4 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded flex flex-col gap-space-xs border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-outline">BƯỚC 04</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[18px]">check_circle</span>
</div>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface font-semibold">4. Đã xác nhận</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Phát hành Hợp đồng đơn hàng, lệnh điều phối xuất xe.</span>
<span class="mt-space-xs inline-block text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold text-primary font-mono tracking-wider">Ký số &amp; Xuất xưởng</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Main Order Intake Workstation Grid (2 Columns: Catalog Table & Order Summary Panel) -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-start">
<!-- Left Column: Validated SKU Catalog Table (Col 8) -->
<div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-md">
<!-- Action Toolbar for the Order Grid -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-space-sm border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-primary-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">inventory_2</span>
</div>
<div>
<h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Danh Mục Sản Phẩm Đặt Hàng Định Lượng</h2>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Chọn số lượng thương mại. Giá tính theo phụ lục hợp đồng đại lý cấp 1.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs">
<button class="px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">file_download</span> Tải Biểu Mẫu Excel
            </button>
<button class="px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">refresh</span> Đặt Lại Số Lượng
            </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- SKU Table Container -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/40">
<div class="overflow-x-auto">
<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
<thead>
<tr class="bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-md text-label-md">
<th class="py-space-md px-space-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Thông Tin Mặt Hàng &amp; Quy Cách</th>
<th class="py-space-md px-space-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center">Trạng Thái Kho</th>
<th class="py-space-md px-space-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center">Đơn Vị Tính</th>
<th class="py-space-md px-space-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-center w-40">Số Lượng Yêu Cầu</th>
<th class="py-space-md px-space-md font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-right">Chính Sách Đơn Giá</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="divide-y divide-surface-container-high font-body-md text-body-md">
<!-- SKU 1: LTB-KEG-AMB01 -->
<tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/60 transition-colors">
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container/20 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mt-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">sports_bar</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary font-bold">LTB-KEG-AMB01</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface">LTB Craft Amber Lager (Keg Inox 20L lạnh)</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">5.2% ABV • IBU 24 • Chuẩn bảo quản lạnh 2°C - 4°C • Van Sankey D</span>
<div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-space-xs text-xs text-on-secondary-fixed-variant bg-secondary-fixed/30 px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded w-fit">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">build</span>
<span>Yêu cầu kỹ thuật: Hỗ trợ đầu nối chữ D tiêu chuẩn Đức</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center align-top pt-space-lg">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded bg-primary-fixed/40 text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span> Tiếp nhận dự kiến
                    </span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center font-mono font-medium align-top pt-space-lg">Keg 20L</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md align-top pt-space-md">
<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 bg-surface-container rounded p-1">
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-keg-amb', -1)" type="button">-</button>
<input class="w-14 text-center bg-transparent font-mono font-bold text-primary focus:outline-none" id="qty-keg-amb" min="0" onchange="updateSummary()" type="number" value="10"/>
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-keg-amb', 1)" type="button">+</button>
</div>
<span class="block text-center text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Tối thiểu: 5 Keg</span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md text-right align-top pt-space-lg">
<div class="flex flex-col items-end">
<span class="px-space-xs py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-right font-medium">
                        [NVKD báo giá theo khung chiết khấu HĐ]
                      </span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Áp dụng HĐ Cấp 1 Đông Nam Bộ</span>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
<!-- SKU 2: LTB-KEG-WHT02 -->
<tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/60 transition-colors">
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-primary-container/20 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mt-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">sports_bar</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary font-bold">LTB-KEG-WHT02</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Golden Wheat Ale (Keg Sanitize 20L)</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">4.8% ABV • IBU 16 • Hương vỏ cam &amp; hạt ngò tây • Men bia tươi</span>
<div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-space-xs text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">verified</span>
<span>Đã tiệt trùng bằng hơi nhiệt cao áp trước khi nạp</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center align-top pt-space-lg">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded bg-primary-fixed/40 text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span> Tiếp nhận dự kiến
                    </span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center font-mono font-medium align-top pt-space-lg">Keg 20L</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md align-top pt-space-md">
<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 bg-surface-container rounded p-1">
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-keg-wht', -1)" type="button">-</button>
<input class="w-14 text-center bg-transparent font-mono font-bold text-primary focus:outline-none" id="qty-keg-wht" min="0" onchange="updateSummary()" type="number" value="5"/>
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-keg-wht', 1)" type="button">+</button>
</div>
<span class="block text-center text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Tối thiểu: 2 Keg</span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md text-right align-top pt-space-lg">
<div class="flex flex-col items-end">
<span class="px-space-xs py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-right font-medium">
                        [NVKD báo giá theo khung chiết khấu HĐ]
                      </span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Áp dụng HĐ Cấp 1 Đông Nam Bộ</span>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
<!-- SKU 3: LTB-CAN-PIL24 -->
<tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/60 transition-colors">
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-secondary-fixed/40 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary mt-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">view_column</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary font-bold">LTB-CAN-PIL24</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Premium Pilsner Canned 330ml</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">5.0% ABV • Thùng carton chuẩn 24 lon nhôm • Pallet xếp 72 thùng</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Hạn dùng: 12 tháng kể từ ngày dập đáy lon</span>
</div>
</div>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center align-top pt-space-lg">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-space-xs py-0.5 rounded bg-primary-fixed/40 text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container"></span> Tiếp nhận dự kiến
                    </span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-sm text-center font-mono font-medium align-top pt-space-lg">Thùng (24 lon)</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md align-top pt-space-md">
<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1 bg-surface-container rounded p-1">
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-can-pil', -5)" type="button">-</button>
<input class="w-14 text-center bg-transparent font-mono font-bold text-primary focus:outline-none" id="qty-can-pil" min="0" onchange="updateSummary()" step="5" type="number" value="50"/>
<button class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface font-bold hover:bg-primary hover:text-on-primary transition-colors flex items-center justify-center text-sm" onclick="adjustQty('qty-can-pil', 5)" type="button">+</button>
</div>
<span class="block text-center text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Bội số: 5 thùng</span>
</td>
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md text-right align-top pt-space-lg">
<div class="flex flex-col items-end">
<span class="px-space-xs py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-right font-medium">
                        [NVKD báo giá theo khung chiết khấu HĐ]
                      </span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Chiết khấu theo sản lượng tháng</span>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
<!-- SKU 4: LTB-BTL-STT24 -->
<tr class="hover:bg-surface-container-low/60 transition-colors">
<td class="py-space-md px-space-md">
<div class="flex items-start gap-space-sm">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-secondary-fixed/40 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary mt-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">liquor</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary font-bold">LTB-BTL-STT24</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Dark Stout Artisanal 330ml</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">6.5% ABV • Chai thủy tinh hổ phách • Thùng 24 chai xách khay gỗ bọc</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Dòng bia cao cấp phục vụ nhà hàng, lounge</span>
</div>
</div>
</td>
